<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://indie-game-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:36:22 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>这款工具把 2D 绘画工作流带进 Unreal Engine 5</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/this-tool-brings-2d-painting-workflows-into-unreal-engine-5</link><description>Inky 工具在 UE5 里复现传统绘画材料的笔触质感，让美术可以直接用 2D 绘画方式做 3D 材质。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">06f563d4015b1e4207822d97add89bedf8236479</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/this-tool-brings-2d-painting-workflows-into-unreal-engine-5">80 Level</source></item><item><title>2026 年 10 月手游榜单：Top Lords 异军突起，腾讯下滑 11%，AI 开始监听</title><link>https://www.pocketgamer.biz/october-2026-mobile-game-charts-top-lords-takes-off-tencent-falls-11-and-ai-listens-in</link><description>AppMagic 数据显示 10 月手游下载与收入榜出现新面孔 Top Lords，腾讯收入下滑 11%，行业对 AI 监听的讨论也在升温。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">73b06247cea83b61402e5428917635c39fbfb98c</guid><source url="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/october-2026-mobile-game-charts-top-lords-takes-off-tencent-falls-11-and-ai-listens-in">PocketGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>你的数据讲的是完整的故事吗？</title><link>https://unity.com/blog/data-fragmentation-ua-monetization-unity-vector</link><description>数据碎片化会让买量与变现团队看不清玩家全貌，文章讲了把 MMP、GA 与内购信号接入 Unity Vector 的代价与做法。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e42e5fdb3a4f172663c2be08260132c0acd45066</guid><source url="https://unity.com/blog/data-fragmentation-ua-monetization-unity-vector">Unity 博客</source></item><item><title>用行业标准工具学做 3A 级游戏角色：完整制作流程大师课</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/learn-the-art-of-making-aaa-game-ready-characters-using-industry-standard-tools</link><description>这门 Wingfox 大师课带你走完游戏角色从建模到成品的完整流程，面向想做出 3A 品质角色的美术从业者。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:39:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">046ddf071eafae8b6a7c8e0b9045b67ffd4c59f6</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/learn-the-art-of-making-aaa-game-ready-characters-using-industry-standard-tools">80 Level</source></item><item><title>Hydrilla 教程：从提示词到引擎，做出你的第一个 BlueFox 道具</title><link>https://dev.to/sugukavi/hydrilla-tutorial-your-first-bluefox-prop-from-prompt-to-engine-5d5k</link><description>一步步演示如何用 Hydrilla 的 BlueFox 1 从提示词或参考图生成带分段网格、UV 与 PBR 贴图的背景道具，并省着用生成额度。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:26:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">9763858371a641a545a52a4f179940a115eb8dde</guid><source url="https://dev.to/sugukavi/hydrilla-tutorial-your-first-bluefox-prop-from-prompt-to-engine-5d5k">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>游戏资产网格拓扑：导出前的一套检查流程</title><link>https://dev.to/meshyai/mesh-topology-for-game-assets-a-pre-export-review-workflow-5gim</link><description>模型在静帧里看着没问题，关节弯折、细分或进引擎后却可能变形，作者给出导出前按用途逐项检查拓扑的实用顺序。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:36:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">022b4f8eefe6cf998d4b75f45fc34a1c49f8f9fb</guid><source url="https://dev.to/meshyai/mesh-topology-for-game-assets-a-pre-export-review-workflow-5gim">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>等了这么久，《燕云十六声》的官方DLSS 5优化有什么不一样</title><link>https://www.yystv.cn/p/14668</link><description>《燕云十六声》官方 DLSS 5 版本即将上线，聊聊它和民间工具相比到底优化了什么。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">ac85e039fbe4f691625aa6597c75b770ba52623c</guid><source url="https://www.yystv.cn/p/14668">游研社</source></item><item><title>小米做的概念超跑，为什么要在游戏里寻求真实感</title><link>https://www.yystv.cn/p/14671</link><description>对话小米汽车设计负责人，聊小米概念超跑如何借《跑车浪漫旅 7》的 Vision GT 企划在游戏中追求真实感，跨界合作的思路对做载具与品牌联动的开发者有参考价值。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bdfded30f687c943adc4609f63854c77163f2dbd</guid><source url="https://www.yystv.cn/p/14671">游研社</source></item><item><title>如何写一份外包美术真正会照着做的游戏美术风格指南</title><link>https://dev.to/juegostudiosofficial/writing-a-game-art-style-guide-that-outsourced-artists-will-actually-follow-64p</link><description>一份美术风格指南好不好用，不看它有多精美，而看它能不能在外包画师赶工时直接回答问题，这篇分享了让指南真正落地的结构与维护方法。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:46:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3ca18397ab46bca6bf151aaf59e5e430bd9ef843</guid><source url="https://dev.to/juegostudiosofficial/writing-a-game-art-style-guide-that-outsourced-artists-will-actually-follow-64p">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Defold 2026 年 11 月通讯</title><link>https://defold.com/2026/11/24/Newsletter-November-2026</link><description>本期 Defold 通讯汇总了即将到来的游戏 Jam 与活动、一个完整的开源 3D 网页游戏示例，以及 Xbox 支持与新资产的最新进展。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bff4bb05ca43f1374d0e9635c8c5e912fb07323a</guid><source url="https://defold.com/2026/11/24/Newsletter-November-2026">Defold 引擎博客</source></item><item><title>Epic 将在虚幻引擎 6 中移除蓝图，AI 将协助迁移</title><link>https://www.pocketgamer.biz/epic-games-to-drop-blueprints-from-unreal-engine-6-as-ai-reshapes-migration-plans</link><description>Epic 确认虚幻引擎 6 将不再支持蓝图可视化脚本与 Actor Gameplay Framework，并表示 AI 会帮助开发者过渡到替代方案。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:35:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a6fc0d1ba0b7aaec50b7aa619b3ae8b75f408525</guid><source url="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/epic-games-to-drop-blueprints-from-unreal-engine-6-as-ai-reshapes-migration-plans">PocketGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>我们的小游戏站赚到了第一笔 7 美分</title><link>https://dev.to/poprecallgames/our-tiny-games-site-earned-its-first-7-cents-2bcb</link><description>作者用纯原生 JavaScript 做了个迷你浏览器游戏合集 Pop Recall，上线两周后收到第一笔 7 美分收入，分享了从零起步的真实账本。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:03:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0b97891aec2640090c6e46ffc13d01174fe3b7ca</guid><source url="https://dev.to/poprecallgames/our-tiny-games-site-earned-its-first-7-cents-2bcb">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>打造游戏可用的虚构军用载具：3D 制作全流程</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/creating-game-ready-fictional-military-vehicle-in-3d</link><description>作者分享原创 8×8 火力支援车 XM-118 Onza 的制作流程，细节内饰、可拆卸炮塔一应俱全，还能在 Unreal Engine 里直接开起来。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:21:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">53b34cf0aeb5ff28755fd76d605767f24e69ba4b</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/creating-game-ready-fictional-military-vehicle-in-3d">80 Level</source></item><item><title>哪个游戏引擎最好：Unity、Unreal 还是 Godot？</title><link>https://dev.to/simulatedsphere/which-is-the-best-game-engine-unity-unreal-or-godot-26pi</link><description>没有放之四海皆准的“最好引擎”，只有最适合特定团队规模与项目形态的引擎，作者按双人手游小队到 20 人系统向团队等场景逐一对照。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:08:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">189423150810367b0a9e8e42e7561b2e41bef515</guid><source url="https://dev.to/simulatedsphere/which-is-the-best-game-engine-unity-unreal-or-godot-26pi">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>在 Unreal Engine 5 里复刻中东市集氛围：细腻打光的实践</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/recreating-the-atmosphere-of-a-middle-eastern-market-in-unreal-engine-5-with-nuanced-lighting</link><description>作者 Wendao 分享了学习全新灯光工作流的心得，讲了如何用色彩分级让场景既有氛围感又保持真实，以及具体的打光手法。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:07:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">64876141b35f8908124afef56d0e68e45458aab5</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/recreating-the-atmosphere-of-a-middle-eastern-market-in-unreal-engine-5-with-nuanced-lighting">80 Level</source></item><item><title>在 Unreal Engine 5 里复刻中东市集氛围</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/recreating-the-atmosphere-of-a-middle-eastern-market-in-unreal-engine-5</link><description>作者 Wendao 分享了学习全新灯光工作流的心得，讲了如何用色彩分级让场景既有氛围感又保持真实，以及具体的打光手法。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:07:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d8ba1e6c70e1746da41a85e12820a3e690517f52</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/recreating-the-atmosphere-of-a-middle-eastern-market-in-unreal-engine-5">80 Level</source></item><item><title>